Amending Act: 3/2016, provision s20
Instruction: In section 37 of the principal Act, in sub-section (1), for clauses (a) and (b), the following clauses shall be substituted, namely:— “(a) refusing to refer the parties to arbitration under section 8; (b) granting or refusing to grant any measure under section 9; (c) setting aside or refusing to set aside an arbitral award under section 34.”.

OLD units:
- s37.ss1.cl(a): granting or refusing to grant any measure under section 9;
- s37.ss1.cl(b): setting aside or refusing to set aside an arbitral award under section 34.

NEW units (slots):
- slot N1 (clause), allowed paths ['s37.ss1.cl(a)']: refusing to refer the parties to arbitration under section 8;
- slot N2 (clause), allowed paths ['s37.ss1.cl(b)']: granting or refusing to grant any measure under section 9;
- slot N3 (clause), allowed paths ['s37.ss1.cl(c)']: setting aside or refusing to set aside an arbitral award under section 34.
